WEBVTT

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.870
Good morning. Do you want to get a morning coffee together?

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:18.870
Do you?

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:31.740
I'm considering making an extended stay.

00:00:31.740 --> 00:00:33.520
Look after things while I'm gone.

00:00:33.520 --> 00:00:34.310
Yes, sir.

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:39.500
Sounds like we'll have nothing to do again, Choco.

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:41.770
Forgive me, Mint.

00:00:41.770 --> 00:00:46.210
Howard Resort is just too irresistible.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.570
What are we going to do about your casino addiction?

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:50.980
Right, Choco?

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:54.370
What was that?

00:01:10.720 --> 00:01:12.430
See you later.

00:01:12.430 --> 00:01:14.670
Don't be a stranger.

00:01:14.670 --> 00:01:16.180
Okay.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:20.920
I hope she likes this place.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:34.240
Between a casino and a walk, going for a walk is more fun.

00:02:14.440 --> 00:02:17.800
I didn't need to see them put it away.

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:19.410
We'll tell the owner.

00:02:19.410 --> 00:02:20.590
We'll tell him.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.970
Huh? What was that?

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:34.540
How lucky. We saw the Goddess of Victory before going to the casino.

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:36.580
Maybe today will be our day.

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:37.900
What are they talking about?

00:02:42.860 --> 00:02:47.010
"Goddess of Victory"

00:03:03.420 --> 00:03:06.090
Hey, is that...

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:08.690
Yeah, isn't that the Goddess of Victory?

00:03:16.280 --> 00:03:18.780
I'm bored.

00:03:18.780 --> 00:03:24.310
You're right, Choco. Why is every casino city the same?

00:03:25.560 --> 00:03:30.030
I want to see something so amazing my heart will burst.

00:03:32.730 --> 00:03:34.540
Hey, it's the Goddess of Victory!

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:36.190
I've never seen her in person before!

00:03:36.190 --> 00:03:37.270
Let's shake her hand!

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.720
The Goddess of Victory's here?

00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:39.410
Where?

00:03:39.410 --> 00:03:40.730
The Goddess of Victory is here!

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:42.470
The Goddess of Victory...

00:03:42.470 --> 00:03:44.250
That sounds interesting.

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:45.660
Goddess of Victory!

00:03:45.660 --> 00:03:47.400
Goddess of Victory!

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.690
What is this Goddess of Victory?

00:03:53.690 --> 00:03:55.070
Could I get your autograph?

00:03:55.070 --> 00:03:56.610
I can't see anything.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:57.960
Could I get a picture with you?

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:00.070
Choco, don't you want to see her, too?

00:04:00.070 --> 00:04:01.710
All right...

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:08.230
I shook her hand! Now I'm sure to win!

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:10.300
Hey, wait! Give me some good luck, too!

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.910
Goddess of Victory!

00:04:21.220 --> 00:04:22.800
She's not here, and I hurt all over.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.460
What on earth is this Goddess of Victory?

00:04:25.460 --> 00:04:26.680
They're talking about Rio.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:32.410
She's quite popular. Even a Hollywood star like me doesn't hold a candle to her.

00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:34.540
Who's Rio, old lady?

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:37.240
Old... You're quite a rude child.

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:39.710
Is Rio the Goddess of Victory?

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.580
Where can I meet her?

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:43.100
Oh, Chip.

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:47.970
Perfect timing, Chip. Take this girl to your master.

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.350
Take me where?

00:04:49.870 --> 00:04:52.210
If you don't hurry, you'll lose him.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:55.400
Okay! Thank you, miss!

00:04:55.400 --> 00:04:57.740
You're not so bad after all.

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:03.850
I found it.

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:15.370
Wait for me.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.070
The casino...

00:05:36.490 --> 00:05:39.050
Awesome!

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:43.230
Hey, Rio-chan.

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:44.410
Our goddess.

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:45.400
It's Rio.

00:05:45.400 --> 00:05:46.220
Hi.

00:05:46.220 --> 00:05:47.840
Hey, Rio!

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:53.000
Where are we going?

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.110
A full house!

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:00.470
Is this yours?

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.150
Thank you.

00:06:06.820 --> 00:06:09.940
I hit the jackpot!

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:12.280
Where did he go?

00:06:12.280 --> 00:06:13.950
What's going on?

00:06:13.950 --> 00:06:15.530
Awesome!

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:17.510
Hooray!

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:19.350
I just saw the goddess walk by!

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:20.400
I saw her, too!

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:22.380
Maybe we'll win big, too!

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:26.090
Hooray!

00:06:26.090 --> 00:06:27.770
Everyone's excited about something.

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:32.050
Hey, wait up!

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:38.000
Everyone gets excited when Rio shows up.

00:06:38.000 --> 00:06:38.990
They get excited.

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:40.570
Wait!

00:06:41.590 --> 00:06:42.870
There he is!

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:44.780
Oh, Chip.

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:51.750
The Goddess of Victory?

00:06:52.480 --> 00:06:54.090
You're Rio?

00:06:54.090 --> 00:06:55.300
Yes.

00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:57.310
What a cute bear.

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.920
What a splendid customer.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.340
I know.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:03.560
This is Choco, and I'm Mint.

00:07:03.560 --> 00:07:04.580
Welcome.

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.560
You wouldn't believe where she came from.

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:07.180
You wouldn't.

00:07:07.180 --> 00:07:08.530
Sorry.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.340
That's got to be it.

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:20.630
How is everything, Mr. Clark?

00:07:20.630 --> 00:07:23.200
This is a wonderful view, Howard-kun.

00:07:23.200 --> 00:07:25.770
Please enjoy yourself.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:28.500
I'm already having plenty of fun.

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:30.340
Oh, Grandfather.

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:33.200
Sorry, Mint.

00:07:33.690 --> 00:07:37.180
I'll have my staff take care of your granddaughter.

00:07:37.770 --> 00:07:39.880
Could that be her? Come in.

00:07:42.710 --> 00:07:43.890
Is this her?

00:07:43.890 --> 00:07:45.180
Yes.

00:07:45.180 --> 00:07:48.330
Very good. There are limits to sexiness.

00:07:48.330 --> 00:07:49.910
Very good thinking.

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.710
You told me to wear this.

00:07:52.710 --> 00:07:55.540
You said the customers would like it when I climb stairs.

00:07:55.540 --> 00:07:57.020
Is that right?

00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:58.790
Rio! It's you!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:07:59.980
We meet again!

00:07:59.980 --> 00:08:01.590
Hello, Miss.

00:08:01.590 --> 00:08:02.450
Here.

00:08:02.450 --> 00:08:03.430
And this is Choco, right?

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:04.190
Yeah.

00:08:04.190 --> 00:08:06.130
You already know each other?

00:08:06.430 --> 00:08:08.890
Is she the staff member you were talking about?

00:08:08.890 --> 00:08:09.980
Yes.

00:08:09.980 --> 00:08:14.390
Rio is Howard Resort's rising star female dealer...

00:08:14.390 --> 00:08:16.290
also known as the Goddess of Victory.

00:08:16.290 --> 00:08:19.420
You know about her, Grandfather?

00:08:19.420 --> 00:08:25.310
According to rumors, her presence thaws the tension of any casino...

00:08:25.310 --> 00:08:28.530
and brings good luck to all the players.

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:31.230
What? You can do all that, Rio?

00:08:31.920 --> 00:08:34.120
I don't know about that...

00:08:34.120 --> 00:08:39.550
I'll put the rumors about you to the test and play a little bit.

00:08:39.550 --> 00:08:42.350
I will show Mint-sama to her room.

00:08:42.350 --> 00:08:43.830
Thank you.

00:08:48.270 --> 00:08:50.440
You live in a hotel?

00:08:50.440 --> 00:08:51.300
Yes.

00:08:54.750 --> 00:08:56.820
Can I help you?

00:08:56.820 --> 00:09:01.100
Not you. I have business with the girl.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:05.900
Take the stuffed animal!

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:14.030
Retreat!

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:22.680
Are you hurt, Mint-sama?

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:28.900
I found something amazing.

00:09:33.470 --> 00:09:36.400
164cm tall.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:40.900
From top to bottom, 91, 59, 87...

00:09:43.040 --> 00:09:46.030
Or maybe 88...

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:48.960
Thank you for waiting, Mint-sama.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:52.350
Just call me Mint, Rio.

00:09:52.350 --> 00:09:54.000
Thank you for waiting, Mint.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:10:00.310
Do you have any idea why that man was after your bear?

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:02.780
I have no idea. Choco's just Choco.

00:10:02.780 --> 00:10:04.750
You're not keeping any secrets from me, are you?

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:07.840
No. I would have told you.

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.310
Have a lucky day.

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:18.070
That was you.

00:10:18.070 --> 00:10:20.740
The owner forced me to do it.

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:22.940
I'm just a dealer.

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:25.670
You were wearing some funny clothes yesterday.

00:10:25.670 --> 00:10:29.130
That's not all. I have to do all kinds of things.

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:31.500
Sounds like he works you really hard.

00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:34.160
But it's all for the customers.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:36.100
Don't you think you're being too nice?

00:10:36.100 --> 00:10:37.450
You think so?

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:00.080
What's wrong with this machine?

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.450
Quit being a cheapskate and pay up!

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:09.030
Go right ahead.

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:09.950
Damn it.

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.080
I suppose it would be immature to get mad...

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:17.350
Winning is a matter of time, and losing is part of the casino experience, too.

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:20.940
I see. Rio must have arrived.

00:11:23.600 --> 00:11:26.730
Please allow me to take your place.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:38.900
What's wrong with him?

00:11:39.430 --> 00:11:43.110
He doesn't have the courage to propose to his lover...

00:11:43.110 --> 00:11:46.400
so he's going to bet it on a game.

00:11:46.400 --> 00:11:47.650
He's going to bet.

00:11:49.260 --> 00:11:51.800
Would you like to place a bet, sir?

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:53.140
Oh, um...

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:54.790
I can't seem to make up my mind...

00:11:54.790 --> 00:11:57.030
It's very important.

00:11:58.050 --> 00:11:59.390
I see.

00:11:59.390 --> 00:12:02.220
Lucky you. Something important is riding on you.

00:12:02.220 --> 00:12:03.140
Good luck.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:04.490
What is she doing?

00:12:04.490 --> 00:12:06.830
Talking to the ball.

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:08.340
Talking to the ball?

00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:09.260
Yes.

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:10.380
That's right.

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:13.440
Make the customer's wishes come true.

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:21.040
Sir.

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:25.220
I hope I'm not being rude, but if you're having trouble choosing a number...

00:12:25.220 --> 00:12:29.820
imagine the one you love when you look at the table.

00:12:29.820 --> 00:12:32.260
Your feelings will guide you to victory.

00:12:43.970 --> 00:12:45.650
Red 23.

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:48.970
23? That's my birthday.

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:51.240
Sorry I'm late.

00:12:53.010 --> 00:12:55.280
Jane, will you marry me?

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:57.850
What? But how will we pay for it?

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:01.530
Okay, Robert!

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:02.820
Jane!

00:13:03.480 --> 00:13:06.070
Congratulations, sir.

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:08.180
Thank you! I owe everything to you!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:11.860
Good job, Rio. You truly are the Goddess of Victory!

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:12.980
The goddess.

00:13:12.980 --> 00:13:15.220
What happened?

00:13:15.220 --> 00:13:18.180
The goddess' kiss inspired the ball.

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:19.460
Inspired it.

00:13:19.460 --> 00:13:22.520
The goddess' kiss inspired it...

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.690
I am sorry about last night.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:25.910
Sir!

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:28.710
You must not enter the dealer's area.

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:32.390
When I saw her, I acted brashly.

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:37.620
Mint!

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:40.680
I don't want to cause a scene.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:44.070
I have an idea. Since we're in a casino...

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:46.860
You want to play a game?

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:49.400
I'm glad you understand.

00:13:49.400 --> 00:13:54.400
I am Orlin Dunhill, also known as the Queen Killer.

00:13:54.990 --> 00:13:57.620
I show no mercy. Not even to children.

00:13:57.620 --> 00:14:01.830
I'm supposed to play? I've never made a bet before...

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:05.620
Looks like your customer is in trouble.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:08.710
Why don't you help her, Rio?

00:14:09.070 --> 00:14:12.330
Wow, it's Rosa Canyon. It's the real deal.

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:17.130
Howard Resort really is amazing to have Hollywood actresses around.

00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:18.810
Rosa's right.

00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:21.470
Our motto is...

00:14:21.470 --> 00:14:23.350
"As the customer wishes."

00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:24.830
Please, Rio.

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:29.660
Excellent. It's an honor to play against you, Goddess of Victory.

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:34.760
If I win, you will tell us why you're after Choco and leave this island.

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:37.720
Oh? Two conditions?

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:41.500
Then you must also bet something else important.

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:42.750
Something else?

00:14:42.750 --> 00:14:45.190
If Rio loses, she'll take her clothes off.

00:14:46.410 --> 00:14:49.040
Didn't you say you'd help me?

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.900
What are you saying, Mint?

00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:54.040
I accept those terms!

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:55.950
Call a film crew!

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:58.130
Let's record this!

00:15:16.870 --> 00:15:18.410
Rio's beautiful.

00:15:18.410 --> 00:15:19.330
She's beautiful.

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:22.360
Why is she wearing a wedding dress?

00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:23.250
It's a ritual.

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:24.270
A ritual?

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:27.330
To make her one with the game.

00:15:27.330 --> 00:15:28.680
One with the game?

00:15:28.680 --> 00:15:31.410
You'll get to see the real Rio.

00:15:34.430 --> 00:15:37.990
Even if Rio loses we'll have some sexy footage to use in a commercial.

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.070
You've got to lose today, Rio.

00:15:42.070 --> 00:15:43.180
Owner.

00:15:43.180 --> 00:15:44.830
That pervert.

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.970
Howard-san looks like he's having fun...

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:52.260
Thank you for waiting, darling.

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.320
Amazing.

00:15:58.710 --> 00:16:02.100
This wedding dress is your masterpiece!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:07.630
My wife left me five minutes before my wedding!

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:09.600
Since then I've had terrible luck with women...

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:12.920
and I've been living the lonely life of a bachelor!

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:17.660
I don't know what you think telling us will do...

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:20.030
You pissed me off!

00:16:20.030 --> 00:16:24.800
I'll tear your clothes off and make sure you never get married!

00:16:24.800 --> 00:16:29.340
You're not the Goddess of Victory! You're my plaything!

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:33.650
I, Rosa Canyon, will be your dealer.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:35.690
The game is closed poker.

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:37.500
You may exchange cards once.

00:16:38.150 --> 00:16:39.440
Let's begin!

00:16:42.630 --> 00:16:47.230
I'll show you why they call me the Queen Killer.

00:16:54.370 --> 00:16:55.920
I'd like to trade cards.

00:16:58.520 --> 00:17:00.420
What? Why?

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:01.810
What's going on?

00:17:01.810 --> 00:17:05.230
If he threw away his eight and got the nine of hearts, he'd have a straight flush.

00:17:05.230 --> 00:17:08.520
If he got the ace of hearts, he'd have a royal straight flush, but...

00:17:08.520 --> 00:17:09.400
But...

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:15.100
I'm going for four queens. They'll come to me.

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:17.830
All the women will come to me!

00:17:24.340 --> 00:17:26.020
Rio's trading one card, too...

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:35.820
She has the same eyes as her mother.

00:17:35.820 --> 00:17:37.600
Rio is enveloping the world...

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.640
and enveloping them.

00:17:39.770 --> 00:17:41.610
Come on!

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.320
Hello.

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:24.080
Get out of here. I don't have any business with you.

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:29.670
I don't have any luck with women, but I have fantastic luck with gambling.

00:18:29.670 --> 00:18:35.200
I'm pathetic with real women, but the women of the game obey my every word!

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:38.580
Get out of my way!

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.240
I've found you. I've found you.

00:18:59.240 --> 00:19:02.400
You're all mine!

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:26.550
I win!

00:19:35.660 --> 00:19:38.360
What?

00:19:41.550 --> 00:19:43.690
Rio, show us your cards.

00:19:51.280 --> 00:19:52.670
What?

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:57.040
A pair of twos. The weakest hand in poker.

00:19:57.040 --> 00:19:59.940
Why did you go for something so weak?

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:06.050
I don't know. I just got the feeling the queens wouldn't go to him.

00:20:07.270 --> 00:20:09.480
The winner is Rio!

00:20:11.290 --> 00:20:13.230
Hooray!

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:18.650
See the true power of this Howard Resort's dealer!

00:20:19.840 --> 00:20:22.210
She could have lost today, though.

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:24.000
No, she should have lost!

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:28.920
Orlin-sama is a stuffed animal fanatic.

00:20:29.670 --> 00:20:34.510
He soothes the pain of losing his wife by collecting them.

00:20:35.270 --> 00:20:40.990
That bear is a collector's item made in Belgium.

00:20:42.080 --> 00:20:45.000
I just wanted to be comforted by it...

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:46.710
I see.

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:50.830
But this says "Made in China" right here.

00:20:51.580 --> 00:20:52.540
You're right.

00:20:52.540 --> 00:20:54.120
It wasn't made in Belgium.

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:54.910
It wasn't.

00:20:54.910 --> 00:20:58.750
What? That's impossible...

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:05.330
I'm glad we learned this customer didn't have the eyes to judge stuffed animals.

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:07.440
What? Uh...

00:21:07.440 --> 00:21:10.500
You should stop expanding your collection of fakes.

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:13.750
Now you don't have to waste any more money.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:16.390
Hey, Rio.

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:18.560
You're not comforting him at all.

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:21.390
You're right. Thank you, Rio.

00:21:21.390 --> 00:21:23.430
No way.

00:21:23.430 --> 00:21:24.540
Way.

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:27.080
You're going to accept that?

00:21:27.080 --> 00:21:28.560
She's so cool.

00:21:28.560 --> 00:21:30.070
You, too?

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:33.330
May you find luck and happiness.

00:21:35.240 --> 00:21:36.450
Wait, Rio!

00:21:36.450 --> 00:21:38.950
Won't you be my big sister?

00:21:42.800 --> 00:21:44.050
The film crew!

00:23:26.030 --> 00:23:28.960
Rio! You should break up with that show-off.

00:23:28.960 --> 00:23:31.690
Mint, this is my first time meeting Elvis.

00:23:31.690 --> 00:23:32.610
First time?

00:23:33.030 --> 00:23:35.140
I'm sending you home!

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:36.690
You're so pushy.

00:23:35.960 --> 00:23:39.780
"Gate Holder"

00:23:36.850 --> 00:23:39.150
You can count on me in the next episode!
